oration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9096916772/original/YOrQ6OkRNj4NK5QBLGKt1VS4gJ-m5mzYaw.png?1582296334\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9096916772\"></span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">To set up period you need to enter the date from the calendar, you can also enter any description and you can tick “De-registered for VAT” checkbox if this is your last VAT submission. This is only needed when you have already cancelled your VAT registration from HMRC’s end. Then click on Save and Next.</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9096919733/original/fEO-2r6e-4iW1rPMlcdIV2znD_OxzW4aDA.png?1582297971\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9096919733\"></strong><br></span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>2) Include/Exclude Transactions</strong></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Here you need to choose which transactions to be included or excluded from VAT return. For this, choose between Sales &amp; Purchase tabs and click '+Include' to add the transactions. Once done, click the Next button.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9096920055/original/fhxKlyIHsZ4Qnpem9WNRCncGGk3n1QDiNA.png?1582298143\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9096920055\"></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>3) Review Return</strong></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">You can review the return, make edits by clicking on edit and view Audit report by clicking on view Audit report. Once ready to proceed with submission, click the 'Submit to Capium' option to save a copy of the return to Capium then click on ‘continue for HMRC submission’</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9096920307/original/qpAG-8pf1YiF_9OZ8CQnxw7mGKy6GKQqxw.png?1582298306\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9096920307\"></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>4) HMRC Gateway Details&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">You need to fill HMRC credentials i.e. user ID and password and If you are an agent then tick checkbox ‘I am an agent’ and click on submit to HMRC icon. Still, you may click on the finish icon in case you are not sure to submit the return to HMRC</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9096921197/original/AyD8y6MH9IOI_HYMFwhl-8IooUdX8585iA.png?1582298774\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9096921197\"></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(226, 80, 65);\"><strong>Note</strong></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">For Cash Based Normal Scheme, you will need to enable the Audit Report manually by ticking the checkbox within VAT Return Report page as shown below</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9115121444/original/Idzgu-HaEJX9FrpXp5RUdmhXUHWANJBF4w.png?1604578131\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9115121444\"></span><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"https://www.useloom.com/share/682cafc27135474c8fc8291f3f589f78\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Click here to watch how to Submit VAT</strong></span></a></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165234\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165234/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165234\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165234/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165234\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-hide-dom=\"#voting-container\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo</span></span></p><a class=\"hide a-link\" id=\"vote-feedback-form-link\" data-hide-dom=\"#vote-feedback-form-link\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">Send feedback</a><div id=\"vote-feedback-container\"class=\"hide\">\t<div class=\"lead\">Sorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.</div>\t<div id=\"vote-feedback-form\">\t\t<div class=\"sloading loading-small loading-block\"></div>\t</div></d